@startuml
' ============================================================================
' METADATA
'   author:       TheRobotDrafts Examples
'   description:  Simple SysML Block Definition Diagram for a Vehicle with composition and a value type.
'   usecase:      Teach «block» stereotyped class, value/part properties, and composition (whole-part).
'   complexity:   simple
'   domain:       automotive
' ============================================================================
title Example BDD - Simple Vehicle

class "Vehicle" <<block>> {
  mass : Mass
  speed : Velocity
  wheelCount : Integer
}

class "Wheel" <<block>> {
  diameter : Length
  pressure : Pressure
}

class "Engine" <<block>> {
  power : Power
  displacement : Volume
}

class "Mass" <<valueType>> {
  value : Real
  unit : "kg"
}

"Vehicle" *-- "4" "Wheel" : wheel
"Vehicle" *-- "1" "Engine" : engine

note right of "Vehicle"
  «block» = SysML unit of structure.
  Composition (*) = whole owns the part
  (part dies with the whole).
end note

@enduml
